                                "sense_id": "2845f651-a58d-36cc-bbac-236df7d383bb",
                                "text": "Do you know where I could find a DIY pipe repair kit?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5517abcb-e8b2-4241-a4f0-3b8dbf8d1d0b",
                                "sense_id": "2845f651-a58d-36cc-bbac-236df7d383bb",
                                "text": "The product knowledge of salespeople is very high, which enables them to serve the demanding customer groups such as professional painters and builders, in addition to the usual DIY consumers."
                            },
